266	// TestRegisterOutOfRangeFieldPrecedence locks where the range rejection sits
267	// relative to the other field checks.
268	//
269	// A value that parses as int64 (the reported 4294967297 and negatives) reaches
270	// the registry, so the long-standing field order applies on every
